2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Carbon\040Trading\072\040A\040Review\040of\040the\040Kyoto\040Mechanisms)
/Author (Cameron\040Hepburn)
/Subject (The\040three\040Kyoto\040flexible\040mechanisms\204emissions\040trading\054\040the\040clean\040development\040mechanism\040\050CDM\051\054\040and\040Joint\040Implementation\040\050JI\051\204have\040always\040been\040controversial\056\040Proponents\040saw\040the\040mechanisms\040as\040clever\040tools\040to\040ensure\040environmental\040outcomes\040were\040achieved\040at\040least\040cost\056\040Reducing\040the\040costs\040of\040compliance\054\040they\040argued\054\040would\040make\040tighter\040environmental\040targets\040possible\054\040and\040certainly\040more\040politically\040feasible\056\040Detractors\040have\040argued\040that\040the\040flexible\040mechanisms\040commoditize\040Earth\047s\040atmosphere\040in\040a\040manner\040that\040will\040allow\040dubious\040projects\040and\040the\040exchange\040of\040\215hot\040air\216\040to\040substitute\040for\040serious\040engagement\040on\040climate\040change\056\040This\040chapter\040reviews\040the\040Kyoto\040flexible\040mechanisms\054\040which\040will\040become\040fully\040operative\040during\040the\040period\0402008\040to\0402012\056\040The\040review\040assesses\040their\040progress\040and\040success\040to\040date\054\040examines\040the\040problems\040that\040have\040emerged\054\040and\040considers\040suggestions\040for\040future\040developments\040in\040climate\040policy\056)
/Keywords (07\040Nov\0402007\054\040Annual\040Review\040of\040Environment\040and\040Resources\054\040Flexible\040Mechanisms\054\040Joint\040Implementation\054\040Kyoto\040Protocol\054\040Clean\040Development\040Mechanism\054\040Emissions\040trading\054\040University\040of\040Oxford)
>>
endobj
